{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/avelia-emaar-properties-the-valley","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1338,"crm_id":"680","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Avelia","slug":"avelia-emaar-properties-the-valley","display_address":"The Valley","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":7250000,"display_price":"7.25M","lattitude":6149419.364270676,"longitude":2888728.422251467,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Avelia at The Valley by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar </a>is the newest premium villa cluster in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/the-valley/\">The Valley</a>, a master community designed around harmony, greenery, and open spaces. Offering <strong>4-bedroom, 5-bedroom Luxury, and 5-bedroom Premium villas,</strong> Avelia blends contemporary architecture with wide plot sizes, airy layouts, private gardens, and multi-level living spaces. Inspired by Emirati wadis, the community incorporates water elements, walking trails, themed parks, and communal green areas that foster calm, creativity, and an active outdoor lifestyle.</p><p>From Plateau Views and The Plantations to Central Park and Village Plaza, Avelia residents enjoy a holistic environment perfect for families who value balance and wellness. With exceptional connectivity to Dubai’s key districts, generous villa proportions, and a handover scheduled for December 2029, Avelia is an investment in refined living and long-term capital appreciation.&nbsp;</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Avelia_by_Emaar_Luxury_4_and_5_BR_Villas_at_The_Valley_40676878ac